          "originalContent" : "+100923804654788847953 This actually started out as a garage door opener for my girlfriend until I realized the Wi-Fi from her house doesn't reach her garage. Since I already had the basis for the app and the software I made some quick changes and now I can use it. I'd hate to give away something so cool anyhow :)\n\nAlso the Spark Core that I posted about right before this is essentially an Arduino with the CC3000 module on it so I can play with that in the future."
